# Minimal reproducer: A is UNSATISFIABLE (HermiT/Konclude agree), km misses it.
# Distilled from ore_ont_7914 (UBERON_0008977). 8 axioms.
# Needs: inverse role (hp=po-), transitive hp, equivalence ⊒-reconstruction at a
# successor, disjointness. The successor h of A (via ∃po.H) is forced into B
# (=F⊓∃hp.G) through the inverse+transitive edge hp(h,a)·hp(a,g), then clashes
# with D (h∈D, D disjoint B). Requires Sequoia r-Succ/r-Pred (engine.rs Table 3,
# NOT IMPLEMENTED) to propagate __trans__hp__G predecessor->successor.
Prefix(:=<http://x.org/>)
Ontology(
SubClassOf(:A ObjectSomeValuesFrom(:po :H))
SubClassOf(:A ObjectSomeValuesFrom(:hp :G))
SubClassOf(:H :F)
EquivalentClasses(:B ObjectIntersectionOf(:F ObjectSomeValuesFrom(:hp :G)))
SubClassOf(:H :D)
DisjointClasses(:D :B)
InverseObjectProperties(:hp :po)
TransitiveObjectProperty(:hp)
)
